sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant SF as Spring Security filter chain
  participant UDS as AppUserDetailsService
  participant DB as MySQL
  U->>B: Enter email and password
  B->>SF: POST /login (CSRF token)
  SF->>UDS: loadUserByUsername(email)
  UDS->>DB: find user by email
  DB-->>UDS: user with BCrypt hash, role, enabled
  UDS-->>SF: UserDetails
  SF->>SF: BCrypt matches(password, hash)
  alt valid and enabled
    SF-->>B: session cookie, redirect /dashboard
    B->>SF: GET /dashboard
    SF-->>B: dashboard for the role
  else invalid or disabled
    SF-->>B: redirect /login?error
  end
